  "kind": "definition",
  "title": "$D_{\\mathrm{cons}}(X,\\Qlb)$",
  "statement": "For a prime $\\ell$ and a scheme $X$, $D_{\\mathrm{cons}}(X,\\Qlb)$ is the bounded constructible\nderived category ([sk-def-sfb-bounded-constructible]) of modules over the coefficient ring\n$\\overline{\\mathbf Q}_{\\ell,X}=p_X^*\\underline{\\Qlb}$: the full subcategory of $D(\\Mod_{\\overline{\\mathbf Q}_{\\ell,X}})$ of\ncomplexes that are bounded and have constructible cohomology sheaves.",
